message: >-
  OpenPulse is academic research software from Ikarus AI Labs. If you use it
  or its results, please cite the technical report below.
title: "OpenPulse"
abstract: >-
  Research instrument for evidence-based dependency decisions: it collects,
  qualifies and applies upstream change evidence to declared dependency
  inventories. Part of the Ikarus AI Labs research programme on
  Evidence-Based Assurance for AI-Mediated Software Change.
